      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "GAP",
      "estimated_duration_s": 17,
      "narration_text": "The gap I would keep watching is cognitive accessibility. The paper finds more attention to visible, machine-detectable issues than to clarity, cognitive load, language, and content structure. That is an opportunity for Humanitarians AI to test whether a page is understandable.",
